  "description": "How far would you go for fame and wealth? Fledgling mommy influencer Ju-Yeon Park is desperate to join the ranks of popular internet celebrities. Thanks to a video of her daughter going viral and her “friend” from high school, popular influencer Ye-Hui Kim, she finally gets the chance to join the ultra-exclusive Deep Pink Society, a group made up of former idols, wealthy CEOs, and social media stars. Elated at the chance to become one of the glittering elite, she’s determined to do whatever it takes to make this work -- no matter the cost.\n\n(Source: WEBTOONS)",
